WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:02.160
Enrique.

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:03.720
Yes, father.

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:05.560
That's the right choice.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.880
After all, someone here

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.960
has acted like an asshole.

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:11.400
That's right, Henry.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.320
You acted like an asshole.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.600
What did I do wrong this time?

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:19.560
You started scheming

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:21.160
against your own brother.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:22.200
That's not how we

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.960
operate in this family.

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:26.760
But I-

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:27.880
Silence.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:29.800
I'm speaking.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:31.360
Walt,

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.080
I'm appointing you

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.400
as chairman.

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:39.640
But on one condition,

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.240
the position will be yours

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:43.360
 in one year.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.440
That's how long you have

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:47.360
to start your own family,

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:50.200
A wife and a child.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:51.360
No.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:52.920
No, no, no.

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:54.640
Now things

00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:56.720
are going to go my way.

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:57.880
Henry.

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:00.040
You made

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:01.520
the wrong choice.

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:03.640
Again, Dad.

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:06.560
You think I'm afraid of death?
